# 🚀 Day 57 – Product Refinement & User Experience

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 57** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I focused on refining the product experience instead of adding new features. Today's goal was to transform the application into a polished, professional, and portfolio-ready product by improving usability, accessibility, responsiveness, and overall user experience.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Enhance the application's overall quality by:

- Improving user experience
- Refining visual design
- Optimizing responsiveness
- Strengthening accessibility
- Creating smoother interactions
- Preparing the product for production deployment

---

